h_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p052","quote":"重黎業之，吳回接之；殷之季世，粥子牒之。周用熊繹，熊渠是續。莊王之賢，乃復國陳；既赦鄭伯，班師華元。懷王客死，蘭咎屈原；好諛信讒，楚并於秦。嘉莊王之義，作楚世家第十。"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p001","quote":"楚之先祖出自帝顓頊髙陽。髙陽者，黃帝之孫，昌意之子也。髙陽生稱，稱生巻章，巻章生重黎。重黎爲帝嚳髙辛居火正，甚有功，能光融天下，帝嚳命曰祝融。共工氏作亂，帝嚳使重黎誅之而不盡。帝乃以庚寅日誅重黎，而以其弟呉回爲重黎後，復居火正，爲祝融。"}],"prior_source_qualifications":[{"source_mention_ids":["c-shiji-130-taishigong:m052-0005"],"metadata":{"label":"吳回（太史公自序候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"original_registry_record_sha256":"3d523ddc679bc7f6a625670c97857d124270806a8e519e6cd2fbb0f04d4002a3","qualification":"合併前來源限定人物label/status/historicity逐值保留；非對現役人物資格的改寫。"}],"rationale":"楚先重黎後由弟吳回續火正；原呉/吳各存，不將重黎拆成130開篇二官。 僅辨同一來源人物，保原字、篇題引用、人名錨及頻次；不由此新增親屬或紀年。","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p001","text":"楚之先祖出自帝顓頊髙陽。髙陽者，黃帝之孫，昌意之子也。髙陽生稱，稱生巻章，巻章生重黎。重黎爲帝嚳髙辛居火正，甚有功，能光融天下，帝嚳命曰祝融。共工氏作亂，帝嚳使重黎誅之而不盡。帝乃以庚寅日誅重黎，而以其弟呉回爲重黎後，復居火正，爲祝融。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001-0006","start":6,"end":11,"surface":"帝顓頊髙陽","kind":"person","person_id":"2to_ofg_fuz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"髙陽","kind":"person","person_id":"2to_ofg_fuz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"8jz_o3s_obt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"昌意","kind":"person","person_id":"dsc_tie_q5s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"髙陽","kind":"person","person_id":"2to_ofg_fuz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"稱","kind":"person","person_id":"2b9_5sw_foy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m001